  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "ILC web host: jco worker, OPFS-backed WASI root, Comlink adapter. Consumed by scaffolded apps as a dependency \u2014 never copied in, so the preview2-shim pin and the OPFS bridge stay fixable in one place.",
